{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf188:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 188, "folio": 571, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Кыргыздуу шерге жел жетпес,", "text": "Кыргыздуу шерге жел жетпес,", "en": "The wind could not overtake the Kyrgyz champion.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
